# P13 batch 1
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0430:00AE"
msgid "dead guardsman "
msgstr "死去的衛兵"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0430:00D1"
msgid "guardsman "
msgstr "衛兵"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:01C4"
msgid "Guardsman! "
msgstr "衛兵！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:026E"
msgid "The Titans are seeking revenge! We are doomed! "
msgstr "泰坦們要復仇了！我們完了！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:0306"
msgid "The very earth shakes and spits up the dead! We must repent for whatever misdeed we have commmitted. "
msgstr "大地在震動，還把死人吐了出來！不管我們犯了什麼錯，都得懺悔才行。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:0362"
msgid "Why is it always -me- you bother? "
msgstr "為什麼你老是來煩「我」？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:03A7"
msgid "What can I do for you? "
msgstr "有什麼事嗎？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:03E1"
msgid "Stop with the questions already. "
msgstr "別再問問題了。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0430:0416"
msgid "What do you want, stranger? "
msgstr "你想幹嘛，陌生人？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0430"
msgid "Bye "
msgstr "再見"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0430"
msgid "Who are you? "
msgstr "你是誰？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:04ED"
msgid "Why do you want to know? "
msgstr "你為什麼想知道？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:054D"
msgid "Only mindless twits go around asking every stranger they meet their name. "
msgstr "只有沒腦子的笨蛋，才會逢人就問名字。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0430"
msgid "What is your duty? "
msgstr "你的職責是什麼？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:05DC"
msgid "I watch over the new Tempest, Devon, of course. "
msgstr "我當然是守護新的風暴使者戴文。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:0622"
msgid "I watch over her Ladyship Mordea, of course! "
msgstr "我當然是守護莫爾迪亞夫人！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0430"
msgid "Where am I? "
msgstr "這是哪裡？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:06A2"
msgid "You are in the palace and home to the Tempest. "
msgstr "你在宮殿裡，這裡是風暴使者的住所。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
msgctxt "bark 0430:06E1"
msgid "Go ask someone who wants to help you. "
msgstr "去問想幫你的人吧。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Bye "
msgctxt "bark 0430:072D"
msgid "To you too. "
msgstr "你也是。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Bye "
msgctxt "bark 0430:07B9"
msgid "If it is true what I heard -- that you had a part in deposing Mordea -- let me offer my thanks. "
msgstr "如果我聽說的是真的——你出了一份力，推翻了莫爾迪亞——那請接受我的感謝。"
